# Social content targeting (hard rules)

## Never target (high SKU / low ticket chaos)
Do **not** write stories or creatives for:
- Grocery / kirana
- Gift shop
- General store
- Mall / hypermarket
- Any business where inventory SKUs dwarf revenue complexity in a “count every biscuit” way

## Target (Sheetomatic ICP)
Prefer stories about:
- Doctors / clinics
- Lawyers / law offices
- Mobile shops
- Furniture shops
- Computer shops
- Jewellery shops
- Fashion boutique brands
- Manufacturing units
- Services businesses
- Tour & travel
- Electronics shops
- Electronic workshops / repair workshops

## Story style
- Sound **human-written**, not AI: specific names, messy details, uneven paragraphs, real talk.
- **Long stories** (not short punchy threads only). LinkedIn caption should feel like a founder recounting a real client-day.
- **Line 1 = hook** — curiosity / tension so people stop scrolling.
- Hinglish OK. No fake metrics. Soft CTA at end.
- Solution = Sheetomatic systems (FMS, IMS, CRM, Tasks, WhatsApp AI, weekly review) without brochure language.
